Why do many people choose galvalume steel sheet now?
Heat resistance Galvalume steel sheet plate has good heat resistance and can withstand high temperatures of more than 300 degrees Celsius.
The corrosion resistance of galvalume steel coil is mainly because of aluminum, the protective function of aluminum. When the zinc is worn away, the aluminum forms a dense layer of aluminum oxide, preventing corrosion-resistant substances from further corroding the interior.
Natural light gray galvalume zinc has a special luster, which is completely different from the color of artificial paint, showing an excellent natural texture. Moreover, the beauty of the building can be maintained from the completion of the renovation to the use of several years.
Conducive to environmental protection The galvalume steel sheet can be 100% smel and recycled again, and will not decompose and discharge harmful substances, so it will not pollute the environment, while other metals that come into contact with pollutants will be eroded or corroded, leak metal ions, and enter groundwater, causing environmental problems.
Galvalume steel sheet not only has a long life, but also has low maintenance costs. Zinc sheet has no surface coating, the coating peels off over time and does not need to be repaired.
