Grower License: This license allows selling marijuana to licensed dispensaries and licensed processors. For this type of license, there are three classes
Class A is a Grower license for 500 marijuana plants,
Class A is a Grower license for 100 marijuana plants,
Retailer: With marijuana dispensary license, you can sell medical marijuana and other marijuana products, including plants and seedlings. Retail stores can’t allow consumption of marijuana unless they have a specific license
Provisioning Center: License authorizes the sale of marijuana to a registered qualifying patient or registered primary caregiver.
