In fact, I want to add an eye protection Buff to myself, You only need a mobile phone or a TV made of OLED.A large number of studies at home and abroad show that，OLED screens have more significant advantages in terms of health than LCD screens. At least at this stage, Mobile phones and TVs equipped with OLED are the devices with the least damage to the eyes.
Blue light is the highest energy wavelength of visible light. This energy can penetrate through the natural filter of the eye to the back of the eye.
but, Both domestic and foreign studies have shown that， OLED is actually more eye-friendly than LCD.
The test results show that， All damage indicators of OLED TVs are lower than those of QD-LCD TVs. The conclusion is, The blue-off emission of OLED TV is less than that of QD-LCD TV, At the same time, the impact on visual fatigue is also smaller.
It’s not just on TV, The same is true on mobile phones.
As part of its “Fighting against LED and White Light Hazards” research, Taiwan’s Tsinghua University (“National Tsing Hua University”) research team led by Professor J.H.Jou has long advocated OLED lighting.
In fact, Foreign studies have also shown this problem.
A professional independent quality inspection company called Intertek in the United Kingdom concluded that, The blue light emitted by the OLED lamp is less than 10% of the blue light emitted by the LED lamp with the same brightness and color temperature.
Another problem is the color display.
We can see the difference between the two from the picture below.
Thanks to the self-luminous technology, OLED can truly display “perfect black”, And achieve infinite contrast. The ability to independently control each pixel allows every detail on the OLED TV screen to be fully displayed without being affected by the overall screen brightness.
In contrast, The myopia rate among American teenagers is about 25%. Australia is only 1.3%, The myopia rate in Germany has also been kept below 15%.
From this perspective, OLED screens are very suitable for Chinese families. With the expansion of the middle class consumer groups, People’s consumption outlook has also changed accordingly, Eye health has also become a purchasing factor that consumers pay more attention to.
In the current high-end TV market,”Eye health” has become the main consumer demand of high-end users, More families prefer to choose more healthy and eye-friendly TVs.
In terms of TV, The family structure of high-end TV users is mainly married with children. The proportion of newly-purchased TVs for children’s health even reached 10%.
OLED TVs have more significant advantages in eye health,It is also the most suitable health choice for Chinese families.
Keeping healthy is the responsibility of life.
