Alicematic Heroes is an area control game with deck building elements, we have the option of playing our Alice cards in our display or with the back side up as simple citizens if we can pay the costs. Our display consists of 5 fields: military, drawing, dream energy, mobility, victory points.
As soon as we have cards in our display, for example dream energy, then we can take them if we have the necessary military strength. On the fields there are numbers from 0-6, which indicate the necessary military strength we need to take the field.
And that makes this game something very special, because the strategic aspect comes into play here. Above all, playing the Alice cards always brings many new possibilities and ways to annoy your opponents.
For each area in which you have the majority you receive 6 victory points. Each city and every mystical garden you occupy earn you victory points and for each area where you have the second majority you receive 3 victory points.
In the end, of course, the one with the most victory points wins.
Alicematic Heroes is thoroughly strategic fun where you can get started quickly. The pleasant playing time is another plus point and speaks in favor of bringing the game to the table from time to time.
So in this sense may belong to the best wonderland.
