Phase 1 "Acquire an attraction" is divided into 3 steps, in "Select attraction"
With "Get attractions" all players reveal their choice at the same time, starting with the bottom player on the slide, which always indicates the order of the players.
A player of the attraction is still available places it on any free space on his game board in front of him and then triggers the effect of the attraction, such as advancing 2 topic points.
Should this occur, the “catch-up move” will take place. Now every player who has not received the desired attraction may choose one of the others.
Phase 3 "Inspection" now the inspector comes by and checks the rank of the individual players in one of the three areas.
At the end of the round it is shown which area will be checked next.
The player with the most visitors after 8 rounds wins the game.
