In this game, everything was really considered and made child-friendly.
During the day the heroes can carry out their actions until all sun tiles on their boards are used up, then the heroes go to sleep and it is the monsters' turn. The dragon die is thrown, all gors on the field must be moved and new ones appear depending on the dragon's position.
The Gors can only be driven out by throwing swords or lightning bolts or you can also use sword markers, which you can find under fog tiles.
Andor Junior managed to enchant us once again with his very own charm, just like the legends of Andor before him.
