"Stop Corona" is a game about the spread and containment of Corona.
There are different character cards in the game:
And different stop cards:
In addition, two action cards
On the map there are 4 boxes with different diagonals and / or virus symbols, the so-called infection probability barometer. Now you put the barometers of both cards on top of each other and check whether you have a match.
If this is not the case, the chain is stopped on a person card and it is the next player's turn. If there is a match, you turn over the next card and now check with the newly infected card from your series whether there is a match, you do this until there is none or the chain is stopped by other cards.
Every now and then it happens that you take a quick test, these are jokers which you can use at any convenient time in the game to stop a chain of infection and you can test the top card of the pile and take a new one if necessary.
You must always avoid triggering an infection on a pile of cards with people. You get to begin with 3 cards in hand, draw a new one every round and discard one if you discard a matching card so no match is lucky, but as soon as someone does not do this he receives the pile, which is put aside.
The topic of corona and avoidance of infection has been brought across and intelligently implemented in a game.
For this we have enclosure and attraction tiles in different shapes.
