The avatars are incredibly powerful monsters that have special abilities, can level up and are almost immortal.
The avatars often feel very strong, but even as a bad player you shouldn't underestimate the strength of the hero, if you lose your avatar too often you only strengthen the hero unnecessarily and it becomes difficult to stop the hero. So let me tell you, the avatars are boss monsters but should also be used wisely.
