The motto cards always have a title, a small text, an explanation of what the outfit consists of and the “must haves”.
Before we come to the final evaluation, one more detail of what you should pay attention to.
As soon as the penultimate player has arrived there, the scoring is triggered immediately. The evaluation phase runs as follows, first the outfit is evaluated, each part brings you the number of points that is shown on it, but only if you have fulfilled the “must haves”, otherwise each part only earns one point.
In addition to this, Guido has to score, the first player takes one of the score chips and can now decide whether he wants to keep it or not.
At the end you add up all the points, who wins the most points and becomes a shopping queen
