An event is always resolved immediately and is then put on the discard pile.
The “Brew” cards are played on the witch board, these magic potions can be used permanently if you have played enough “secret tokens” on these potions.
As a reminder: The witch needs the secret tokens, because she can use them to produce 3 to 1 favor tokens in exchange. 3 favor tokens on the villager who is the witch and she can end the ritual on her turn.
“Charm” spells are very versatile and can destroy dangerous situations or advantages for the hunter. The “Discredit” card allows you to remove an ally of the witch hunter from his board.
These cards are played on a special board and bring advantages for the witch, up to 3 enchantements can be displayed at the same time, but the 2nd and 3rd have to be paid more expensive. The hunter can destroy the enchantement by paying the costs (in the lower right corner) on the card.
