you unlock new skills, which can increase awareness and the
Each round consists of 6 phases:
Income phase - Receive money from your investments and pay, if you want, to unlock an advantage tile.
Patrol phase - the police begin to cordon off the escape routes.
City phase - the city is gradually revealed.
Order of Play Phase - Change the order of play for the remainder of this round.
Player Action Phase - Divided into 5 sections (morning, afternoon, evening, night, dusk).
Change of Day Phase - Prepare for the next day.
