Take out the tent. Open the outer tent completely, align the opening of the door with the inner tent, cover the inner tent with the coated surface (the inner side of the outer tent, smooth to the touch) facing down, and adjust the position of the outer tent so that it basically completely covers the inner tent.
Connect the small hooks on the four corners of the outer tent to the D-rings at the four corners of the inner tent.
Take out and untie the rope. Tie the free end of each tent rope to the webbing tab of the outer tent, adjust the adjustment rope buckle, place the end of the tent rope 1.5 meters away from the tent, and fix it with tent nails as before.
