Protection level to IP followed by two numbers to express, numbers used to make clear the level of protection.
The second number indicates the waterproof. The highest level is 8
0: no protection
1: Water droplets will not affect the shell
5: Rinse with water without any harm
7: Resistance to water immersion in a short time (1m)
