Testing whether the grounding resistance meets the requirements of the standard and promise the safety of lights to humans.
There are three points important to resistance:
The material of the external wire,the copper wire, which has strong conductivity and low resistance
The cross-section of the wire, the larger,the smaller resistance,according to the IEC standard, the cross-section of the wire need ≥ 0.75 square millimeter ， we totally meet the standard and higher than the market.
The chip board,there is a part which connect the ground wire,must need tighten the screw,or will lose conductivity.
