LITETITE® is the complete blackout (99%) fabric roller blind − ideal for environments where blackout conditions are sometimes required, for example; chart rooms, control rooms, cinemas, training rooms, laboratories, workshops and accommodation areas onboard marine vessels and ships.
Available in a large selection of fabric colours LITETITE® effortlessly turns day into night, ensuring total privacy and giving a warm homely feel. The large selection of fabric colours means it can be perfectly coordinated to your other room decorations.
Like all Solar Solve products, LITETITE® is designed with our customer in mind to ensure it is easy to install and simple to operate.
LITETITE® blackout blinds come in two systems, one for inside the recess and the other for outside the recess. When ordering please state whether you require the Inside or Outside Recess system.
